{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":487625,"name":"Brian Thompson","username":"brianrobt","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/brianrobt/{size}/57379_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-09T18:22:12.441Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-487625-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-487625-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-487625-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-487625-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOfficial Todoist plugin stays stuck on Needs auth with 0 tools. Clicking Authenticate on Plugins → Installed → Todoist does not open a browser or the Todoist app. Instead a toast appears: “Couldn’t start sign-in for Todoist. The connector reported no details.”\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFrom the agent side, AuthenticateMcpServer (including force re-authorize) fails before sign-in starts with server check “unreachable” — not a missing credential. Restarting MCP servers did not help.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSupport ticket: T-F50688 (email with Sam). Sam’s steps (update, full quit, Authenticate from Installed) were followed; we cannot get past step 3 because Authenticate never opens a browser.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRelated but different: \u003ca href=\"https://forum.cursor.com/t/grok-bot-ios-todoist-reconnect-fails-once-with-code-challenge-required-for-public-clients/170895\" class=\"inline-onebox\"\u003eGrok Bot iOS Todoist reconnect fails once with code_challenge required for public clients\u003c/a\u003e (iOS gets to Todoist OAuth; this desktop case never starts OAuth).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-487625-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-487625-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eInstall official Todoist plugin in Grok Bot desktop (plugin id 56809986).\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen Plugins → Installed → Todoist. Account “default” shows Needs auth.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eClick Authenticate.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eObserve toast: “Couldn’t start sign-in for Todoist. The connector reported no details.” No browser/app opens.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAgent force re-authorize / MCP restart still reports unreachable; tools remain 0.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-487625-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-487625-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAuthenticate should open the Todoist OAuth browser flow so the connector can connect and expose tools.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-487625-operating-system-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-487625-operating-system-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMacOS\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-487625-version-information-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-487625-version-information-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGrok Bot version: 0.44.0\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-487625-for-ai-issues-which-model-did-you-use-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-487625-for-ai-issues-which-model-did-you-use-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eFor AI issues: which model did you use?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNot applicable — Grok Bot desktop\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-487625-for-ai-issues-add-request-id-with-privacy-disabled-8\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-487625-for-ai-issues-add-request-id-with-privacy-disabled-8\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eFor AI issues: add Request ID with privacy disabled\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSupport ticket: T-F50688\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-487625-additional-information-9\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-487625-additional-information-9\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eAdditional Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOther official connectors on the same account work (GitHub, Linear, Craft, Google Calendar, Calendly).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHappy to try uninstall → full quit (Cmd+Q) → reinstall → Authenticate again and report back. Please let me know if you need any more information.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eScreenshot:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/2/e/2ee5bcfc16480708209d784fd4a415db97d5564a.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/6GSaSF0vhcH0ErX41tfs7Q7xee6.png?dl=1\" title=\"Screenshot 2026-09-09 at 11.31.18 AM\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/2/e/2ee5bcfc16480708209d784fd4a415db97d5564a_2_600x499.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-09-09 at 11.31.18 AM\" data-base62-sha1=\"6GSaSF0vhcH0ErX41tfs7Q7xee6\" width=\"600\" height=\"499\" srcset=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/2/e/2ee5bcfc16480708209d784fd4a415db97d5564a_2_600x499.png, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/2/e/2ee5bcfc16480708209d784fd4a415db97d5564a.png 1.5x, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/2/e/2ee5bcfc16480708209d784fd4a415db97d5564a.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"1C1C1C\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eScreenshot 2026-09-09 at 11.31.18 AM\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e853×710 23.3 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-487625-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-10\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-487625-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-10\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo - Cursor works, this is only in Grok Bot.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-09-09T23:33:23.470Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":5,"readers_count":4,"score":1.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":171183,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-desktop-todoist-authenticate-never-opens-browser-unreachable-toast-only-t-f50688","display_username":"Brian Thompson","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":5,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://forum.cursor.com/t/grok-bot-ios-todoist-reconnect-fails-once-with-code-challenge-required-for-public-clients/170895","internal":true,"reflection":false,"title":"Grok Bot iOS Todoist reconnect fails once with code_challenge required for public clients","clicks":0}],"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":50239,"hidden":false,"trust_level":1,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-desktop-todoist-authenticate-never-opens-browser-unreachable-toast-only-t-f50688/171183/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accept